  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: Equation of parabola is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math>  and the equation of circle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>64</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p>We know that, equation of normal to parabola is given by, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Also, the centre of given circle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>The normal of parabola is passing through center of circle.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> on parabola is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>am</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>am</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
